WEBVTT

00:01:37.280 --> 00:01:40.210
Perfect day for an afternoon nap.

00:01:40.620 --> 00:01:47.180
The rainy season and exams are over, and all that's left is to wait for summer vacation.

00:01:47.570 --> 00:01:49.650
I see someone got here ahead of us!

00:01:50.580 --> 00:01:53.190
Sumomo-chan, Shikimori-san...

00:01:53.190 --> 00:01:54.070
Hime-chan!

00:01:54.070 --> 00:01:54.630
Anri-san!

00:01:59.610 --> 00:02:02.130
I'm going back to the classroom.

00:02:02.130 --> 00:02:03.360
Ah, Ibuki-chan...

00:02:03.810 --> 00:02:05.370
Good morning.

00:02:06.370 --> 00:02:08.400
What the heck is with her?

00:02:08.400 --> 00:02:14.960
She's just fine when it's the two of us, but when somebody else comes...

00:02:16.200 --> 00:02:20.640
I want her to be friendly with everyone else.

00:02:20.640 --> 00:02:22.550
What should I do?

00:02:24.220 --> 00:02:32.310
<b>The Befriend Ibuki Plan</b>

00:02:32.400 --> 00:02:35.870
So that's what Sumomo told me.

00:02:36.260 --> 00:02:41.200
Though at the time she said that she'd try a little more on her own.

00:02:41.200 --> 00:02:44.550
I guess it didn't work.

00:02:44.550 --> 00:02:47.030
She seems really strong-willed.

00:02:47.030 --> 00:02:50.870
But we don't know much about her.

00:02:50.870 --> 00:02:55.630
Don't worry!  I figured this would come up so I got somebody to help.

00:02:55.630 --> 00:02:56.560
Somebody to help?

00:02:57.130 --> 00:02:59.110
Sorry we're late.

00:02:59.110 --> 00:03:05.050
We saw Ibuki-sama to class, but on the way back my brother got lost...

00:03:05.050 --> 00:03:06.850
I'm truly sorry.

00:03:06.850 --> 00:03:08.520
Saya-chan!

00:03:08.520 --> 00:03:10.170
Kamijou-kun.

00:03:10.800 --> 00:03:13.990
You want to know how to become friends with Ibuki-sama?

00:03:13.990 --> 00:03:16.330
That's a challenge.

00:03:16.330 --> 00:03:20.820
Do you know what she likes, or what makes her happy?

00:03:21.160 --> 00:03:27.280
Lately, she's been very happy on days she gets a boxed lunch from Sumomo...

00:03:27.620 --> 00:03:31.760
I received another boxed lunch from that girl today.

00:03:31.760 --> 00:03:33.580
Wait just a second.

00:03:33.580 --> 00:03:36.720
How is that very happy?

00:03:36.720 --> 00:03:43.190
Well, Ibuki-sama almost never talks about what goes on at school.

00:03:43.190 --> 00:03:46.410
She must've been extremely pleased.

00:03:46.410 --> 00:03:49.750
Anything other than boxed lunches?

00:03:49.750 --> 00:03:51.860
Something that would make her happy.

00:03:52.580 --> 00:03:54.100
Something she'd like...

00:03:54.100 --> 00:03:56.150
Other than a boxed lunch?

00:04:01.060 --> 00:04:05.710
What could we do that would make Ibuki-sama happy?

00:04:05.710 --> 00:04:10.780
I can't think of a single thing!  I am the embodiment of epic fail!

00:04:11.650 --> 00:04:14.770
I guess that's enough for today.

00:04:14.770 --> 00:04:17.250
Y-Yeah...

00:04:23.780 --> 00:04:26.540
What would make her happy, huh?

00:04:28.880 --> 00:04:32.600
She seems kind of strange.  I can't even imagine.

00:04:34.120 --> 00:04:36.150
What do you think Soprano?

00:04:36.150 --> 00:04:38.140
<i>It's a difficult question.</i>

00:04:38.140 --> 00:04:42.080
<i>But I think you shouldn't do anything too weird.</i>

00:04:42.080 --> 00:04:45.000
Nothing too weird...

00:04:45.420 --> 00:04:48.930
Then I'll stick...to...basics...

00:05:06.360 --> 00:05:08.830
Morning!  Morning!  Good morning!

00:05:17.720 --> 00:05:19.070
Good morning!

00:05:19.410 --> 00:05:21.890
Good morning, Hime-chan!

00:05:21.890 --> 00:05:23.350
Morning!

00:05:23.710 --> 00:05:26.060
The weather's nice today, huh?

00:05:30.500 --> 00:05:34.880
I'd like to have lunch with Shikimori-san today.

00:05:34.880 --> 00:05:37.380
Of course, you're more than welcome!

00:05:37.380 --> 00:05:39.340
Let's each lunch together!

00:05:40.630 --> 00:05:42.360
Jun-san, too?

00:05:42.360 --> 00:05:43.790
Yeah.

00:05:43.790 --> 00:05:46.220
Oh dear...

00:05:46.710 --> 00:05:48.190
Sumomo-chan?

00:05:48.660 --> 00:05:51.820
Want to have lunch with me today?

00:05:51.820 --> 00:05:53.670
That girl, too.

00:05:53.670 --> 00:05:55.800
Sure, Hachi-san!

00:05:55.800 --> 00:05:57.540
There you are!

00:05:57.540 --> 00:05:59.150
Sumomo-chan!

00:05:59.580 --> 00:06:07.850
I thought about it all last night, and I figure the best way to be friends with her is have lunch together.

00:06:08.270 --> 00:06:13.560
And so let's have lunch on the roof today with her!

00:06:13.560 --> 00:06:16.020
Sure, I'd love to!

00:06:17.210 --> 00:06:20.020
I have a bad feeling about this.

00:06:27.420 --> 00:06:29.780
I'd like to place my order!

00:06:30.700 --> 00:06:31.980
Right away!

00:06:31.980 --> 00:06:36.080
I just don't have Anri-chan's energy...

00:06:36.080 --> 00:06:38.040
Me, too!

00:06:38.480 --> 00:06:40.040
Yes!

00:06:40.040 --> 00:06:43.370
I didn't think my breasts would be smaller either...

00:06:43.370 --> 00:06:44.320
Fine!

00:06:44.320 --> 00:06:47.030
I've got an adult's appeal.

00:06:47.030 --> 00:06:50.610
Fine, fine, don't pull me so hard!

00:07:00.870 --> 00:07:02.120
Hello!

00:07:06.030 --> 00:07:10.370
So, you want me to eat all this?

00:07:10.370 --> 00:07:13.230
That would make me very happy.

00:07:13.230 --> 00:07:16.800
I didn't think you'd all make lunches.

00:07:17.240 --> 00:07:20.040
We all had the same idea.

00:07:20.040 --> 00:07:23.010
If you can't, then just eat mine.

00:07:23.010 --> 00:07:26.830
Mine is spiced with love!

00:07:26.830 --> 00:07:28.800
Eat up!

00:07:30.260 --> 00:07:31.430
I'm going home.

00:07:33.480 --> 00:07:35.240
Ibuki-chan!

00:07:35.240 --> 00:07:37.680
Looks like that failed.

00:07:44.160 --> 00:07:49.620
I bet we could be friends if she had fun with us.

00:07:49.620 --> 00:07:53.770
Which means karaoke or an arcade?

00:07:53.770 --> 00:08:01.680
Uhm, I'm sorry to interrupt, but I think karaoke might not be a good idea...

00:08:01.680 --> 00:08:02.980
Did something happen?

00:08:02.980 --> 00:08:06.320
I'd never in my wildest dreams envisioned such a tragedy...

00:08:09.060 --> 00:08:11.450
I see.

00:08:12.530 --> 00:08:14.970
Karaoke's out, which leaves us with...

00:08:15.450 --> 00:08:18.360
Stop pulling me!

00:08:18.360 --> 00:08:20.400
Where are we going anyway?

00:08:20.400 --> 00:08:22.320
Just come on.

00:08:22.320 --> 00:08:23.140
Shinya!

00:08:23.140 --> 00:08:23.670
Saya!

00:08:23.670 --> 00:08:25.360
Do something!

00:08:25.360 --> 00:08:29.200
You're all out to get me, aren't you?!

00:08:32.140 --> 00:08:35.730
Hey!  What is this place?

00:08:39.790 --> 00:08:40.650
Brother!

00:08:40.650 --> 00:08:42.630
That's not it!

00:08:40.680 --> 00:08:45.640
SIGN:  Cabaret Club

00:08:42.630 --> 00:08:45.640
Oh, that would have been bad.

00:08:56.500 --> 00:08:57.940
Yo, Sumomo-chan.

00:08:57.940 --> 00:08:59.340
What a coincidence!

00:08:59.340 --> 00:09:01.300
Hachi-san!

00:09:01.300 --> 00:09:04.020
Fate must have drawn us here together!

00:09:04.020 --> 00:09:07.040
Why don't you and your girlfriend there play a round with me?

00:09:11.650 --> 00:09:15.590
Kohinata Sumomo, you had better not...

00:09:15.590 --> 00:09:18.440
Let's play one, Ibuki-chan...

00:09:24.010 --> 00:09:26.060
Do you know how to play?

00:09:26.060 --> 00:09:28.830
Do not mock me!  I can drive a car!

00:09:29.260 --> 00:09:30.850
Have you ever done it?

00:09:30.850 --> 00:09:32.180
You don't have a license.

00:09:32.980 --> 00:09:35.790
I've never done it, but I'll figure it out!

00:09:37.240 --> 00:09:39.230
Ibuki-chan, good luck!

00:09:39.510 --> 00:09:41.170
Start!

00:09:59.090 --> 00:10:02.350
She crashed after just 3 seconds.

00:10:02.350 --> 00:10:04.820
Come on guys, it's her first time!

00:10:12.250 --> 00:10:14.720
This is pretty easy once you get the hang of it.

00:10:19.720 --> 00:10:20.650
Accursed machine!

00:10:27.950 --> 00:10:31.350
This game mocks me!

00:10:32.020 --> 00:10:34.250
Calm down, Ibuki-sama!

00:10:34.250 --> 00:10:35.730
Please, calm yourself!

00:10:35.930 --> 00:10:37.930
Silence!

00:11:05.210 --> 00:11:08.790
What do you want to do next, Ibuki-chan?

00:11:08.790 --> 00:11:12.040
Do you enjoy humiliating me that much?!

00:11:12.040 --> 00:11:14.210
No, I just...

00:11:14.210 --> 00:11:19.670
One more word and I'm never speaking to you again, Kohinata Sumomo!

00:11:19.670 --> 00:11:21.640
Ibuki-chan...

00:11:21.640 --> 00:11:22.790
I'm going home!

00:11:22.790 --> 00:11:23.690
Saya!

00:11:23.690 --> 00:11:24.560
Shinya!

00:11:25.210 --> 00:11:26.690
Ibuki-sama!

00:11:28.910 --> 00:11:31.160
So this failed, too.

00:11:31.160 --> 00:11:34.510
I don't think the idea itself was that bad.

00:11:36.890 --> 00:11:40.620
I wanted to take a picture with her...

00:11:40.620 --> 00:11:46.590
This game center lies in an ill-omened direction from the school.  It's bad luck.

00:11:46.590 --> 00:11:48.530
Koyuki-senpai!

00:11:48.530 --> 00:11:50.850
If the direction is bad, then what should we do?

00:11:57.500 --> 00:12:00.010
Bowling?

00:12:10.850 --> 00:12:13.010
Bowling, you say?

00:12:13.010 --> 00:12:16.890
Yes, you take a ball about this size and go like this...

00:12:20.600 --> 00:12:23.500
And knock down pins a few meters away.

00:12:23.500 --> 00:12:28.870
By the way, there are ten pins total, and they're not as big as my brother.

00:12:28.870 --> 00:12:30.780
I know that!

00:12:30.780 --> 00:12:34.230
I'm asking why I have to go bowling.

00:12:34.880 --> 00:12:39.550
Sumomo has been calling and calling.

00:12:39.550 --> 00:12:42.070
She asks that you allow her a chance to apologize for today.

00:12:44.340 --> 00:12:49.460
She truly cares about you.

00:12:49.460 --> 00:12:55.000
I'd go if it were just her, but those idiots she hangs out with...

00:12:55.000 --> 00:13:02.000
<i>Ibuki-sama, if they act in a manner that is offensive to you, merely give me the order.</i>

00:13:02.000 --> 00:13:03.650
I see.

00:13:03.650 --> 00:13:08.280
Inflict sufficient pain and they'll leave me alone.

00:13:08.280 --> 00:13:10.030
Very well!

00:13:10.030 --> 00:13:13.460
I shall attend this "bowling" of theirs!

00:13:17.060 --> 00:13:19.340
It looks like its bigger than Shinya.

00:13:19.340 --> 00:13:22.690
You don't use that in the actual game.

00:13:29.090 --> 00:13:32.950
I see.  This is a bowling alley, huh?

00:13:32.950 --> 00:13:35.290
Ibuki-chan, over here!

00:13:41.850 --> 00:13:45.380
This is heavier than I thought.

00:13:47.870 --> 00:13:49.800
Here I go!

00:14:01.550 --> 00:14:03.450
Are you OK, Ibuki-chan?

00:14:04.150 --> 00:14:09.070
Wow, that was surprising.  For a moment there I there I thought she was doing some amazing special move.

00:14:09.070 --> 00:14:10.030
Hachi...

00:14:15.230 --> 00:14:16.860
Ibuki-sama?

00:14:16.860 --> 00:14:18.010
I'm fine.

00:14:24.680 --> 00:14:27.410
Take fingers out of ball!

00:14:29.890 --> 00:14:32.340
Where did it go?

00:14:32.340 --> 00:14:35.300
My head...

00:15:02.660 --> 00:15:04.390
I did it!

00:15:04.390 --> 00:15:05.670
They went down!

00:15:05.670 --> 00:15:07.440
Congrats!

00:15:08.590 --> 00:15:13.650
Now that we've all had a chance to practice, let's pair up and play a game!

00:15:13.650 --> 00:15:15.250
I agree!

00:15:15.250 --> 00:15:16.910
I've been waiting for this!

00:15:16.910 --> 00:15:21.380
The winning team gets to eat all they want for lunch!

00:15:21.380 --> 00:15:24.080
The losing team has to play a punishment game!

00:15:24.080 --> 00:15:26.460
Everybody, take it seriously!

00:15:26.460 --> 00:15:27.880
Yes!

00:15:27.880 --> 00:15:29.910
Don't mess up, guys.

00:15:29.910 --> 00:15:30.620
Right!

00:15:35.140 --> 00:15:36.930
Nice, Yuuma!

00:15:36.930 --> 00:15:39.300
Not bad...

00:15:39.300 --> 00:15:42.300
I guess I'll just have to show my true power!

00:15:42.300 --> 00:15:45.270
Anri-chan, you're going to bowl with your left hand?

00:15:45.270 --> 00:15:52.320
I'm actually left-handed, but my left-hand is so incredibly powerful I almost never use it.

00:15:52.320 --> 00:15:54.310
But I'll be using it today.

00:15:55.090 --> 00:15:57.270
Limiter release!

00:16:02.340 --> 00:16:04.140
What power...

00:16:05.150 --> 00:16:06.610
How's that?

00:16:09.210 --> 00:16:11.220
OK, my turn.

00:16:17.300 --> 00:16:19.610
Oh, no!  Gutter ball!

00:16:19.610 --> 00:16:21.580
Tama-chan, go!

00:16:21.580 --> 00:16:23.580
<i>Right, miss!</i>

00:16:24.910 --> 00:16:26.880
Ka-boom!

00:16:34.260 --> 00:16:36.050
I got a strike!

00:16:36.050 --> 00:16:39.750
The use of magic during games is prohibited.

00:16:39.750 --> 00:16:43.320
We ask that you refrain from its use.

00:16:43.320 --> 00:16:45.720
Oh, my.  They got mad at me.

00:16:45.720 --> 00:16:47.760
Of course they did!

00:16:51.610 --> 00:16:53.030
Did you see that, Saya?

00:16:53.030 --> 00:16:54.140
I got a strike!

00:16:54.140 --> 00:16:57.640
My dear brother, that's the next lane over.

00:16:57.640 --> 00:16:59.370
What?

00:17:09.100 --> 00:17:10.990
Don't mind that, Ibuki-chan!

00:17:16.210 --> 00:17:17.390
Go!

00:17:17.390 --> 00:17:18.850
Take that!

00:17:29.810 --> 00:17:32.620
OK, time to announce the results!

00:17:32.620 --> 00:17:36.740
First place is me and Haruhi, the "School of Magic Beauties" team!

00:17:36.740 --> 00:17:38.610
Oh my, "beauties" eh?

00:17:38.610 --> 00:17:43.130
Second is Jun-chan and Koyuki-senpai's "Mysterious Beauty" team!

00:17:43.130 --> 00:17:45.090
We were so close.

00:17:45.090 --> 00:17:46.200
Beauty?

00:17:46.200 --> 00:17:47.930
We all know he's a guy, right?

00:17:47.930 --> 00:17:50.270
That's why it's "mysterious"...

00:17:50.270 --> 00:17:54.170
Third is Hachi and Yuuma's male team!

00:17:54.170 --> 00:17:56.850
Fourth is the Kamijou siblings!

00:17:56.850 --> 00:18:03.160
And last is Sumomo-chan and Ibuki-chan's freshman team!

00:18:03.160 --> 00:18:06.020
I'm in last place?

00:18:06.020 --> 00:18:08.470
What humiliation!

00:18:08.470 --> 00:18:12.680
I'm sorry.  I'm not that good at bowling...

00:18:12.680 --> 00:18:18.630
OK then, the losing team will have a punishment game as promised!

00:18:20.560 --> 00:18:24.610
I-I don't want to play anymore games!

00:18:24.610 --> 00:18:26.130
That's OK.

00:18:26.130 --> 00:18:27.090
It's not a game.

00:18:30.330 --> 00:18:34.530
You two are going to take cosplay pictures here!

00:18:34.900 --> 00:18:37.010
Yay!  That sounds fun!

00:18:37.010 --> 00:18:39.030
C-Cosplay?

00:18:39.030 --> 00:18:43.740
Ibuki-sama, cosplay is short for "costume play"...

00:18:43.740 --> 00:18:46.500
That's not the question here.

00:18:46.500 --> 00:18:49.480
I-I'm not dressing like that...

00:18:49.480 --> 00:18:52.990
I'll pick out something really nice for you.

00:18:52.990 --> 00:18:54.630
Bi-Bisaim!

00:18:54.630 --> 00:18:55.440
<i>Right!</i>

00:18:58.490 --> 00:19:01.850
This isn't a good place to do that.

00:19:03.780 --> 00:19:05.820
Quickly!

00:19:07.770 --> 00:19:08.920
I'm going, too!

00:19:11.390 --> 00:19:13.060
S-Stop it!

00:19:13.060 --> 00:19:14.300
Not that outfit!

00:19:20.980 --> 00:19:25.070
It's OK.  I'm sure it'll be fine.

00:19:26.690 --> 00:19:29.040
Well?  Does it work?

00:19:30.220 --> 00:19:32.530
It's perfect!

00:19:32.530 --> 00:19:34.180
Now Ibuki-chan...

00:19:34.180 --> 00:19:36.640
OK, picture time!

00:19:36.640 --> 00:19:38.600
Ibuki-sama...

00:19:38.600 --> 00:19:41.010
Well?  Great, huh?

00:19:41.010 --> 00:19:43.100
Perfect!

00:19:43.440 --> 00:19:48.080
Why am I the only one who has to wear a humiliating outfit like this?

00:19:48.410 --> 00:19:50.890
So it'll be all right if everybody else does it?

00:19:50.890 --> 00:19:53.920
But, I don't think there are any more outfits like that...

00:19:53.920 --> 00:19:56.030
Let's go, Soprano.

00:19:56.030 --> 00:19:58.350
<i>Yes, Haruhi.</i>

00:20:01.080 --> 00:20:05.560
<i>El Amdaltory Els Falti.</i>

00:20:10.230 --> 00:20:13.290
<i>Ri Kulkeross!</i>

00:20:17.090 --> 00:20:18.820
Oh, my...

00:20:23.560 --> 00:20:24.860
Great!

00:20:24.860 --> 00:20:28.450
I always wanted to try this.

00:20:28.450 --> 00:20:30.480
Now I'm a bunny girl.

00:20:30.480 --> 00:20:32.950
Now, let's take a picture.

00:20:36.460 --> 00:20:37.690
All right!

00:20:39.080 --> 00:20:40.840
OK, pose!

00:20:46.680 --> 00:20:48.970
It looks great!

00:20:50.000 --> 00:20:53.120
Haruhi, change our outfits and let's take another!

00:20:53.120 --> 00:20:54.200
All right!

00:20:54.200 --> 00:20:55.820
<i>Ri Kulkeross!</i>

00:21:00.010 --> 00:21:02.210
<i>Ri Kulkeross!</i>

00:21:19.500 --> 00:21:22.750
I wonder if Ibuki-chan had fun.

00:21:22.750 --> 00:21:26.680
It's fine.  She stayed until the end.

00:21:26.680 --> 00:21:28.720
She looked so happy!

00:21:29.250 --> 00:21:32.830
Yeah, from now on we're all friends.

00:21:38.790 --> 00:21:41.000
Then we'll be going.

00:21:41.000 --> 00:21:42.950
Goodbye.

00:21:44.410 --> 00:21:46.960
We can go again.

00:21:48.670 --> 00:21:50.120
Bowling.

00:21:50.120 --> 00:21:53.790
The honor of the Shikimori family demands that I avenge my loss.

00:21:53.790 --> 00:21:55.950
Ibuki-sama...

00:21:56.420 --> 00:21:59.930
The punishment game is cosplay pictures, right?

00:22:00.930 --> 00:22:01.730
Right!

00:22:02.230 --> 00:22:03.030
Yes!

00:22:06.070 --> 00:22:07.860
<i>Ibuki-sama...</i>

00:22:08.210 --> 00:22:12.340
<i>Did you notice it?  That spell...</i>

00:22:13.640 --> 00:22:15.490
I know.

00:22:17.990 --> 00:22:20.580
I know...

00:23:55.010 --> 00:24:24.970
<b>Next Episode</b>

00:23:55.330 --> 00:23:59.140
How are all of you spending your hot summer days?

00:23:59.140 --> 00:24:00.640
I'm Kamisaka Haruhi!

00:24:00.640 --> 00:24:06.750
I was watching this TV show, and I said to myself, "Why not start off the program with a seasonal greeting?"

00:24:06.750 --> 00:24:09.550
It's a secret what show it was.

00:24:09.550 --> 00:24:10.780
Huh?  It's not hot?

00:24:10.780 --> 00:24:12.020
It's actually cold?

